-## Scope of this pass
-
-The three-room arrangement contains 28 placements. The five regular solids can be picked up; the twelve new sphere examples vary rings and segments independently. The existing counter has no resize control or frame-time meter, and its samples are not grabbable. Eight additional PrimitiveMesh prefab scenes are displayed at rest in the third room. The sixteen older secondary/decorative placements remain in the side alcove. Native desktop approach and supplied pickup were tested; headset reach and legibility remain unverified.
+The museum's pillars, sphere comparisons and capsule extend this investigation. Here we have gained one reusable operation: a function that takes a value and returns data. A short rule can produce a body; its output remains something we can inspect and alter.
